&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;display: none; max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://click.appcast.io/greenhouse-te8/a31.png?ent=34&amp;amp;e=22630&amp;amp;t=1701374353806&quot; width=&quot;1px&quot;&gt; &lt;img style=&quot;display: none; max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://track.jobadx.com/v1/i.gif?utm_pixel=224e990b-8ff4-4287-8d5d-2ff09647f181&amp;amp;utm_ptz=EST&amp;amp;utm_rqt=track&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Telemetry Platform&lt;/strong&gt; team is the backbone of real-time intelligence at DoorDash. We are architecting a unified, multi-brand foundational platform that powers sub-second user intent detection and mission-critical product experimentation for millions of users globally. Our team manages the entire data lifecycle—from high-performance mobile/web SDKs to massive-scale ingestion stacks and complex event processing engines. We are currently transitioning to a cutting-edge &lt;strong&gt;ingestion stack&lt;/strong&gt;, creating a drift-free instrumentation culture that turns raw behavioral signals into actionable business insights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a platform-oriented &lt;strong&gt;Engineering Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to lead a multi-disciplinary team of &lt;strong&gt;Full Stack &lt;/strong&gt;and &lt;strong&gt;Data Infrastructure (Backend)&lt;/strong&gt; engineers. In this role, you will play a pivotal part in building these teams from the ground up and driving the long-term technical strategy for global telemetry. You will oversee the development of everything from developer-facing web UIs for schema management to high-throughput backend systems that process billions of events. This is a unique opportunity to lead a team at the intersection of platform engineering and deep data infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’re excited about this opportunity because you will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and Scale Teams:&lt;/strong&gt; You will lead the hiring, onboarding, and mentorship of a high-performing team of Full Stack and Data Infrastructure engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; You will execute the roadmap for the &lt;strong&gt;Unified Telemetry platform&lt;/strong&gt;, balancing immediate &quot;quick wins&quot; with long-term engineering excellence and global scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bridge Frontend &amp;amp; Backend:&lt;/strong&gt; You will manage the development of the &lt;strong&gt;Event Schema Design UI&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;ClickStream Event Inspector&lt;/strong&gt; alongside the &lt;strong&gt;Complex Event Processing (CEP)&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Enrichment Frameworks&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enable Global Impact:&lt;/strong&gt; Your team’s work will directly enable real-time user intention detection (e.g., identifying checkout abandonment) and power the foundational data layers for DoorDash’s global analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Foster Culture:&lt;/strong&gt; You will champion a culture of reliability, quality, and technical rigor, ensuring telemetry is a &quot;winning edge&quot; for the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re excited about you because you have…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 10+ years of experience in software engineering, with at least 2+ years of hands-on management experience leading high-growth teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Stack &amp;amp; Infra Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; You have a strong understanding of both modern &lt;strong&gt;Front End frameworks&lt;/strong&gt; (for internal tooling/governance UIs) and &lt;strong&gt;Data Infrastructure&lt;/strong&gt; (high-throughput ingestion, distributed systems, and real-time processing).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Breadth:&lt;/strong&gt; Familiarity with technologies like &lt;strong&gt;Go&lt;/strong&gt;/&lt;strong&gt;Kotlin/Python&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;React&lt;/strong&gt;, and large-scale data ecosystems such as &lt;strong&gt;Kafka, Spark Streaming, Flink&lt;/strong&gt;, or Snowflake.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven ability to break down complex, large-scale systems into reusable components and clear execution plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional communication skills with a track record of partnering with Product, Data Science, and Platform teams to deliver global solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; B.S., M.S., or PhD in Computer Science or a related technical field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-weight: 500;&quot;&gt;Notice to Applicants for Jobs Located in NYC or Remote Jobs Associated With Office in NYC Only&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We use Covey as part of our hiring and/or promotional process for jobs in NYC and certain features may qualify it as an AEDT in NYC. As part of the hiring and/or promotion process, we provide Covey with job requirements and candidate submitted applications. We began using &lt;a href=&quot;https://getcovey.com/product/covey-scout-inbound&quot;&gt;Covey Scout for Inbound&lt;/a&gt; from August 21, 2023, through December 21, 2023, and resumed using &lt;a href=&quot;https://getcovey.com/product/covey-scout-inbound&quot;&gt;Covey Scout for Inbound&lt;/a&gt; again on June 29, 2024.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Covey tool has been reviewed by an independent auditor. Results of the audit may be viewed here: &lt;a style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot; href=&quot;https://getcovey.com/nyc-local-law-144&quot;&gt;Covey&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About DoorDash&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At DoorDash, our mission to empower local economies shapes how our team members move quickly, learn, and reiterate in order to make impactful decisions that display empathy for our range of users—from Dashers to merchant partners to consumers. We are a technology and logistics company that started by enabling door-to-door delivery, and we are looking for team members who can help us go from a company that is known as the place you order food to a company that people turn to for any and all goods.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;DoorDash is growing rapidly and changing constantly, which gives our team members the opportunity to share their unique perspectives, solve new challenges, and own their careers. We&#39;re committed to supporting employees’ happiness, healthiness, and overall well-being by providing comprehensive benefits and perks.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re committed to growing and empowering a more inclusive community within our company, industry, and cities. That’s why we hire and cultivate diverse teams of people from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives. We believe that true innovation happens when everyone has room at the table and the tools, resources, and opportunity to excel. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If you need any accommodations, please inform your recruiting contact upon initial connection.&lt;/p&gt;
