&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_f449ba3fd55bed50-798&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;1,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;1,4,0,0&quot;&gt;You are highly comfortable navigating ambiguity, managing changing operational circumstances, and making data-backed decisions under pressure&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;1,4,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
