&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree or 2+ Years of industry experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in using Issue Tracking Software such as Jira&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional analytical skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to collaborate and communicate effectively across different functional teams&lt;/li&gt;
