&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with version control tools such as Git and ability to run basic commands/workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with one or more data analytics and business intelligence tools, such as Sigma&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with SQL&lt;/li&gt;
