&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;display: none; max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://click.appcast.io/greenhouse-te8/a31.png?ent=34&amp;amp;e=22630&amp;amp;t=1701374353806&quot; width=&quot;1px&quot;&gt; &lt;img style=&quot;display: none; max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://track.jobadx.com/v1/i.gif?utm_pixel=224e990b-8ff4-4287-8d5d-2ff09647f181&amp;amp;utm_ptz=EST&amp;amp;utm_rqt=track&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re building the future of DoorDash India, and that starts with the teams who hire it. Our India Talent Acquisition team partners closely with business leaders to build high-performing, candidate-first hiring experiences at scale. This role sits in the center of that motion, supporting high-volume Customer Support hiring through coordinated, well-run hiring events and strong recruitment operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a highly organized, proactive Talent Acquisition Coordinator to own the logistics behind large-scale hiring events for Customer Support roles in India. You’ll partner with recruiters, hiring managers, interviewers, and operations stakeholders to keep candidate flow moving, deliver a strong candidate experience, and make sure every hiring event runs smoothly. Over time, this role can expand into university, apprenticeship, and employer-brand activation as our hiring model evolves.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’re excited about this opportunity because you will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own end-to-end coordination for on-site and virtual hiring events, including scheduling, venue logistics, candidate communications, and day-of support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with recruiters and hiring managers to keep high-volume Customer Support pipelines moving quickly and accurately.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate candidate interview schedules, assessment centers, confirmations, and follow-ups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track candidates and hiring activity in the ATS, keeping records clean, current, and usable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support reporting on hiring progress, event outcomes, candidate experience, and process bottlenecks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross-functionally with TA, HR Operations, and business stakeholders to remove friction from the hiring process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help improve recruiting workflows, templates, and candidate communications as volume and complexity grow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support future hiring activations such as university events, apprenticeship campaigns, and brand-led talent outreach as the role broadens.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re excited about you because you have…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1 to 3 years of experience in recruiting coordination, HR operations, event coordination, or a fast-paced administrative role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organization, follow-through, and attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence managing lots of moving pieces without losing the human side of the candidate experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear written and verbal communication skills in English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working with scheduling tools, spreadsheets, ATS systems, and shared calendars.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A bias for action, strong judgment, and the ability to stay calm when plans change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in high-volume hiring, candidate experience, and building repeatable processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative style and comfort working across teams and reporting lines in a matrixed environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting high-volume hiring, customer support hiring, or contact center hiring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to campus, apprenticeship, or early-career programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with on-site interview days, assessment centers, or hiring events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with employer branding, talent marketing, or recruitment campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What success looks like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hiring events run smoothly and on time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Candidates get clear, timely communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruiters spend less time on logistics and more time on hiring decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Event-to-offer and event-to-join data is visible and actionable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The role becomes a reliable operational engine for India TA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About DoorDash&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
