&lt;li&gt;Partner with the hiring managers and their team to develop creative strategies for engaging with and closing top talent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive large-scale talent acquisition initiatives by planning and executing mass hiring drives and campus recruitment campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help influence hiring decisions at each point in the recruiting process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use data, your knowledge, and industry trends to build creative closing strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help create an outstanding candidate experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re excited about you because…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
