&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;You have 4+ years of technical recruiting experience, including experience closing candidates in-house and a focus on engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have an in-depth understanding of market mapping, talent research, and candidate identification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have mastered successful pipeline management&lt;/li&gt;
